# Build context = repository root; only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md,
# .git_archival.txt (version of a git-archive bundle), src/, schemas/ (snapshot
# contract, packaged into the wheel) and deploy/release-keys/ are used.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!.git_archival.txt
!src/
!deploy/release-keys/
!schemas/
src/**/__pycache__
src/**/*.pyc
